{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33950","headline":"奉和鲁望徐方平後闻赦次韵 · 皮日休","name":"奉和鲁望徐方平後闻赦次韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金鸡烟外上临轩，紫诰新垂作解恩。\n涿鹿未销初败血，新安顿雪已坑魂。\n空林叶尽蝗来郡，腐骨花生战後村。\n未遣蒲车问幽隐，共君应老抱桐孙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33950.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33950","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}